{
  "name": "dsh-anim-pack",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "美术素材包（V1.1）：341 种代码动画风格提示词 / 193 张参考静帧 / 244 条像素特效（pixelfx）/ 远端美术参考图库 / 本地元素提取 / 124 张 video-shotcraft 镜头配方卡 / 设计工艺库（8 条美学锚点、24 条 CSS 版式模式、15 条审查准则）/ 外接素材库（liaoyunart.com 1.6 万条 + Iconify 图标 + ambientCG、Poly Haven 的 CC0 材质与 HDRI）/ 文字与前端美化（180 条艺术字·文字动效·装饰件·背景配方 + 71 条字体种子），共 46 个 anim_* 工具。anim_design_brief 一次给出风格/镜头/特效/工艺/文字/配色参考包，做前端设计前先调它；anim_asset_* 找成品素材，anim_type_* / anim_font_* / anim_brand_kit / anim_background 出 CSS。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "animation",
    "pixel-art",
    "sprite",
    "extract",
    "image",
    "video",
    "storyboard",
    "remotion",
    "shot",
    "asset-library",
    "icon",
    "texture",
    "material",
    "hdri",
    "typography",
    "font",
    "brand-kit",
    "icon-set",
    "css"
  ],
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./catalog": "./lib/catalog.js",
    "./fx": "./lib/fx.js",
    "./image": "./lib/image.js",
    "./vision": "./lib/vision.js",
    "./prompt": "./lib/prompt.js",
    "./extract": "./lib/extract.js",
    "./shots": "./lib/shots.js",
    "./brief": "./lib/brief.js",
    "./design": "./lib/design.js",
    "./assets": "./lib/assets.js",
    "./type": "./lib/type.js",
    "./type-tools": "./lib/type-tools.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/",
    "assets/",
    "docs/",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "cordis": "*",
    "react": "^18.2.0 || ^19.0.0"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
